# ci.yml always runs on pull requests and skips its heavy jobs on docs-only
# changes itself (its `changes` job, as in project-water-management), so the
# docs-only stand-in gate isn't needed, and it would let a .claude/-only PR
# merge without the `claude-tooling` guard.
.github/workflows/ci-gate-docs.yml
